WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.944
The fairies followed the wish smoke.

2
00:00:02.945 --> 00:00:06.742
As they flew, the sky got darker.

3
00:00:06.743 --> 00:00:09.945
The wind blew hard.

4
00:00:09.946 --> 00:00:12.639
Feather had trouble flying.

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:23.206
"It's hard to fly in this wind!" she called.

6
00:00:23.207 --> 00:00:29.047
"I'm really tired." Hob groaned.

7
00:00:29.048 --> 00:00:35.758
"Keep going!" Sprite said.

8
00:00:35.759 --> 00:00:42.420
The wish smoke led to a small brick house.

9
00:00:42.421 --> 00:00:45.517
The fairies landed in a tree.

10
00:00:45.518 --> 00:00:49.896
"Now we need to get a wishbit," Feather said.

11
00:00:49.897 --> 00:00:53.142
Crack! Thunder boomed.

12
00:00:53.143 --> 00:00:58.684
The tree shook in the wind as rain poured down.

13
00:00:58.685 --> 00:01:05.751
Feather moaned. "My wings are soaked!"

14
00:01:05.752 --> 00:01:12.458
"Uh-oh." Bumble pointed to the house.

15
00:01:12.459 --> 00:01:15.075
"The people just closed the windows.

16
00:01:15.076 --> 00:01:18.567
How will we get inside for a wishbit?"

17
00:01:18.568 --> 00:01:23.826
Hob gulped. "I'm not sure."

18
00:01:23.827 --> 00:01:27.747
Sprite was looking around.

19
00:01:27.748 --> 00:01:31.633
"I see a soccer net in the backyard.

20
00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:34.538
Maybe we can shrink it."

21
00:01:34.539 --> 00:01:36.820
Feather shook her head.

22
00:01:36.821 --> 00:01:41.583
"Shrinking powder doesn't work in the rain."

23
00:01:41.584 --> 00:01:46.677
Sprite's shoulders slumped. "You’re right."

24
00:01:46.678 --> 00:01:50.869
"What will we do?" Bumble asked.

25
00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:53.251
"Wait here," Sprite said.

26
00:01:53.252 --> 00:02:04.208
She flew to the backyard and darted around the grass.

27
00:02:04.209 --> 00:02:10.423
Then she flew back to the others.

28
00:02:10.424 --> 00:02:14.459
"What did you find, Sprite?" Bumble asked.

29
00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.469
Sprite held up a gold whistle on a cord.

30
00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:21.913
"This—it has Mabel's name on it."

31
00:02:21.914 --> 00:02:29.466
"The whistle is metal—are you itchy?" Bumble asked.

32
00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:35.721
"No." Sprite shook her head.

33
00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:40.423
"Then come on!" Feather said as rain poured down.

34
00:02:40.424 --> 00:03:02.411
"Let's go the Wish Factory—before the storm gets worse!"

35
00:03:02.412 --> 00:03:05.776
Blinx frowned as he took the whistle.

36
00:03:05.777 --> 00:03:07.620
"You're getting me wet.

37
00:03:07.621 --> 00:03:10.721
And you brought me a wet wishbit!"

38
00:03:10.722 --> 00:03:15.699
"Sorry, Blinx," Bumble said.

39
00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:27.286
Blinx sighed and took the wishbit into the back.

40
00:03:27.287 --> 00:03:30.183
A few moments later he returned.

41
00:03:30.184 --> 00:03:32.764
Blinx gave the whistle to Feather.

42
00:03:32.765 --> 00:03:38.550
"Bring this thing back to Mabel—and let me get dry!"

43
00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:46.968
He slammed his door shut.

